  "sourceTitle": "Tuned/abliterated Qwen3.8-27b into a 24gb card 262k guff using the newest unreleased version of LexiPanel. It's fast with reliable draft acceptance. Made for 7900xtx but should work on whatever 24gb card with this setup and headless. Doesn't get dumber while coding like most of the other fine-tunes.",
